// buckets, then the named key field types mask_t, bits_t, quant_t,
// groups_t, kernel_t, acc_t, align_t, discrete/integrated,
// inference/training and plain_k/transposed_k), the EU count the entry is
// tagged to (any_eu: every device of the architecture), and the
// fwd_config_t tile configuration.
